sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: From a medial straight line there arise irrational straight lines infinite in number, and none of them is the same as any preceding.
----
proof:

Let {A} be a medial straight line.

I say that from {A} there arise irrational straight lines infinite in number, and none of them is the same as any of the preceding.

